# All keys are OPTIONAL. The headline replication (fetch artifacts, build data,
# run the pipeline, score) needs no keys at all.
#
# Keys unlock the optional legs only:
#   OPENAI_API_KEY     frontier zero-shot baselines via eval/baselines_openai.py
#   ANTHROPIC_API_KEY  frontier zero-shot baselines via eval/baselines_anthropic.py
#   GEMINI_API_KEY     frontier baselines (eval/baselines_gemini.py) and the
#                      fact-level judge legs (eval/judge*.py)
#   HF_TOKEN           only for gated Hugging Face repos; none of this release's
#                      artifacts are gated
OPENAI_API_KEY=
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
HF_TOKEN=
